  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Revision vs By Advs. Sri.C.S. Dias on 30 May, 2018 Author: P.Ubaid Bench: P.Ubaid In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present: The Honourable Mr. Justice P.Ubaid Wednesday, The 30Th Day Of May 2018 / 9Th Jyaishta, 1940 Crl.Rev.Pet.No. 2090 of 2005 Against The Judgment In Cra 316/1998 of Ii Addl.Sessions Court, Thiruvananthapuram Against The Judgment In Cc 663/1996 of J.M.F.C.-Ii,Attingal Revision Petitioner(S)/Appellant In Crl.A.No.316/1998/Accused Shihabudeen, S/O.Shahul Hameed, Abida Bhavan, Pothencode. By Advs. Sri.C.S. Dias, Sri.Ajit Murali Respondent(S)/1St Respondent/2Nd Respondent In Crl.A.316/1998: 1. A.Jayakumar, Food Inspector, Thiruvananthapuram Circle. 2. State Of Kerala, Rep. By Public Prosecutor,, High Court Of Kerala, Ernakulam.",
    "facts": "The revision petitioner herein challenges the conviction and sentence against him under Sections 2(ix) (a) and (c), 7(ii) and 16 (1) (a) (i) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act. This is a case involving mis-branding. When the Food Inspector demanded a particular article, the retailer sold another article. To prove the alleged mis- branding, the food article was sent for analysis and report of analysis was received from the Regional Laboratory. Relying on the report of analysis, the Food Inspector filed complaint before the Judicial First Class Magistrate Court-II, Attingal. 2. The accused entered appearance and contested the case. On full trial, he received conviction also.",
    "arguments": "Now the accused is before this Court in revision challenging the legality and propriety of the conviction and sentence. 3. This is a case where the Pepsico decision of the Hon'ble Supreme Court is applicable.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Now the accused is before this Court in revision challenging the legality and propriety of the conviction and sentence.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": "3. This is a case where the Pepsico decision of the Hon'ble Supreme Court is applicable."
  },
